OL,3,CJournalist and broadcaster Rod Liddle
OL,4,Cdies aged 66
OL,6,FJournalist and broadcaster Rod Liddle
OL,7,Fhas died after a short illness at the
OL,8,Fage of 66, his family has said.
OL,10,FLiddle was a high-profile columnist
OL,11,Ffor The Sunday Times and The Sun, and
OL,12,Fhad a weekly column in The Spectator,
OL,13,Fas well as a Times Radio show.
OL,15,FHis children, Wilder, Tyler and Emmy,
OL,16,Fsaid in a statement: "We're all very
OL,17,Fsaddened and shocked at the sudden
OL,18,Fpassing of our wonderful father.
OL,26,@xD@VOU
