PN,30502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785773923
OL,3,CJournalist and broadcaster Rod Liddle
OL,4,Cdies aged 66
OL,6,F"He raised us much as you might
OL,7,Fimagine, to be inquisitive, brave and
OL,8,Falways humorous.
OL,10,F"Even in hospital in the last few
OL,11,Fweeks, he consistently held the room
OL,12,Fand never let the awful situation show.
OL,14,F"He has left a legacy that we are all
OL,15,Fincredibly proud of, he will always be
OL,16,Four guide on how to live an
OL,17,Fextraordinary life."
OL,19,FLiddle died at The James Cook
OL,20,FUniversity Hospital in Middlesbrough
OL,21,Fon Sunday evening.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@AOUvD@AOUyD@TO]
