OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785773923
OL,3,CJournalist and broadcaster Rod Liddle
OL,4,Cdies aged 66
OL,6,FRebekah Brooks, chief executive of
OL,7,FNews UK, said: "Everyone at News UK is
OL,8,Fdeeply shocked and saddened to learn
OL,9,Fof the sudden death of Rod Liddle.
OL,11,F"Rod was an inimitable journalistic
OL,12,Fforce, brilliant, provocative and
OL,13,Fimmensely talented, whose sharp wit
OL,14,Fand uncompromising voice graced our
OL,15,Fpages and airwaves for decades.
OL,17,F"Whether writing for The Sunday Times
OL,18,Fand The Sun or broadcasting on Times
OL,19,FRadio, he challenged conventional
OL,20,Fthinking and left an indelible mark on
OL,21,FBritish journalism.
OL,26,@oD@POUsD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/4
