OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F305A1785773923
OL,3,CJournalist and broadcaster Rod Liddle
OL,4,Cdies aged 66
OL,6,F"Rod will be greatly missed by all his
OL,7,Ffriends and colleagues at News, as
OL,8,Fwell as by his many readers, listeners
OL,9,Fand viewers.
OL,11,F"Our thoughts and sincerest
OL,12,Fcondolences are with his family and
OL,13,Floved ones."
